{
 "priority": 7,
 "source_bins": [
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "But this time's different. He's trying to create a level playing field for all the publishers.": "",
  "And that's tied to his announcement, I take it?": "",
  "Yes, exactly.": "",
  "I see. Well, do you know what his criteria is going to be?": "",
  "Apparently, Katagiri-sensei is going to come up with a \"problem,\" and the first publisher to solve it gets the rights.": "",
  "A problem?": "",
  "Yes. And that's where you come in!": "",
  "Solving problems is a detective's job, right!? Just like Falco Edison!": "",
  "Those are novels... In real life, even he'd struggle with those cases.": "",
  "Don't be such a downer! Come on, my company is going to live or die on this! Please, Yagami-san!": "",
  "If you can do it, how does 180k sound?": "",
  "If you don't end up being able to solve it, at least you tried!": "",
  "...All right, that sounds like a pretty good deal.": "",
  "Then it's settled! Thank you!": "",
  "But again, no promises that I can solve this riddle of his.": "",
  "Well, the announcement is happening soon. Are you ready to head over?": "",
  "Hold on, I need a few.": "",
  "No problem. Let me know when you're ready.": "",
  "Let's go, then.": "",
  "We should get going, Yagami-san. Are you ready?": "",
  "Here we are. Looks like we just made it.": "",
  "Ladies and gentlemen, and esteemed publishers...": "",
  "I am pleased to welcome the world-renowned author, Takumi Katagiri to the venue, so that he may announce his book.": "",
  "So without further ado... Please welcome Katagiri-sensei!": "",
  "Let me first thank all of you for coming today.": "",
  "I'm not usually one for this kind of extravagance, but today I have my reasons.": "",
  "As you know, I have a new work to announce, and I'm confident it will be as good, if not better, than the Edison series.": "",
  "But I've not made any decisions concerning who will publish the work at this time.": "",
  "I've always felt the field was a bit unfair, and this time I'd like to give every publisher an equal shot.": "",
  "As such, I've devised this \"problem.\" Whoever can solve it, will be awarded the publishing rights.": "",
  "You'll want to put your thinking caps on, everyone.": "",
  "This is it! It's all on your shoulders, Yagami-san!": "",
  "Yeah, no pressure or anything...": "",
  "Allow me to give you a few more details concerning this \"problem\" we have for you!": "",
  "The problem's solution will be the combination to this safe on stage.": "",
  "Katagiri-sensei's master script for his new book is locked inside.": "",
  "If you feel you've solved the problem, simply come on stage and attempt to unlock it.": "",
  "If the safe opens, you have won the publishing rights!": "",
  "Now, are you all ready for the problem itself? Then let's get underway!": "",
  "Yagami-san! Have you figured it out?": "",
  "Hmm, let me think for a sec.": "",
  "(Let's think about this...)": "",
  "(There must be a pattern to convert the alphabet into numbers. It seems like C and B have the widest gap...)": "",
  "(Maybe there's a meaning to the shapes of each letter?)": "",
  "(Something that A, B and D have that C doesn't. It seems B has more than both A and D...)": "",
  "Oh, I think I have it.": "",
  "Really!? Then what are you waiting for!? Go open the safe!": "",
  "O-Okay...": "",
  "Ah! It seems we have a potential solution! Your name, sir?": "",
  "Um, I'm Yagami with Cloudy Skies Publishing.": "",
  "How confident are you, Yagami-san?": "",
  "I guess I'm pretty confident.": "",
  "Very well, then! You may attempt to unlock the safe!": "",
  "(All right, just gotta enter the code.)": "",
  "(I should check the problem again...)": "",
  "(Okay...)": "",
  "(The code is...)": "",
  "Oof! It seems like that was incorrect! You'll have to reconsider!": "",
  "(Damn! I was wrong... I should check my work.)": "",
  "It's okay. As long as nobody else gets it first, you can give it another shot!": "",
  "Yeah... Anything you'd like to contribute, Kawada-san?": "",
  "I-I have no idea...": "",
  "Why don't you get some fresh air and try again, Yagami-san?": "",
  "...Yeah, good idea.": "",
  "Then please give it another shot!": "",
  "Whoa! It opened.": "",
  "Perfect! Incredible! Cloudy Skies Publishing has solved the problem!": "",
  "Congratulations. It seems I can entrust my newest work to you, Cloudy Skies.": "",
  "I didn't think the problem would be solved so easily... Next time I'll have to make it harder.": "",
  "Yesssss!": "",
  "Yagami-san, let me know when you're ready to head back!": "",
  "Were you able to cool your head, Yagami-san? Do you want to go back?": "",
  "I need a bit more time.": "",
  "Okay! Let me know when you're ready.": "",
  "Let's head back.": "",
  "Thank you so much, Yagami-san! Our company is saved!": "",
  "Glad I could help. I think I even surprised myself a little. Haha.": "",
  "Oh, don't be so modest. I'm glad I came to you, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Here's your payment, as promised.": "",
  "I have a lot to discuss about our contract with Katagiri-sensei, so I suppose I should be off!": "",
  "Yes! Thank you so much again! If you'll excuse me!": "",
  "Ahh! Shijima-kun, I told you, there's no smoking here!": "",
  "I apologize, Yagami-san. You shouldn't have had to see that.": "",
  "This is Otoya Shijima, an artist associated with our talent agency.": "",
  "What kind of artist?": "",
  "Wait, you don't know who I am? What kind of remote mountain village are you from that you haven't heard of me?": "",
  "Uh, sorry. I don't have time to watch much TV.": "",
  "Don't be rude, Shijima-kun! I apologize, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Don't sweat it. Why don't you take a seat, Hayama-san.": "",
  "So, what can I do for you today?": "",
  "Well, it's about the performance Shijima's going to be doing in Kamurocho...": "",
  "It would've been fine, but he's being hounded by a scandal of sorts...": "",
  "Of sorts?": "",
  "We knew he had a bad rep when we signed him, but some of his past... indiscretions have come to light in recent days.": "",
  "So what if I used to ride motorcycles over sidewalks with my crew and stuff?": "",
  "And I mean, I guess we snatched a few things for shits and giggles...": "",
  "So, reckless endangerment and theft.": "",
  "Oh come oooon, it was more than ten years ago. I read online that it's past the statute of limitations.": "",
  "(Well, you could start by at least pretending to be sorry...)": "",
  "The timing is unfortunate. I think this event is going to draw quite a crowd of reporters.": "",
  "But that would ruin the whole performance, especially if he's caught by them.": "",
  "I understand the situation, I suppose. But I still don't get how I fit in.": "",
  "Yes, about that... We'd like to ask you to... Well...": "",
  "Be the decoy for Shijima.": "",
  "It's simple. You dress up like me and draw the attention of the annoying media flies away from me.": "",
  "Then I don't get held up by them and I can go on stage as planned.": "",
  "Sure, but... If you haven't noticed, you and I have some very different looks going on...": "",
  "We've taken that into account, actually...": "",
  "Shijima-kun. I brought your outfit.": "",
  "I have to wear it right now?": "",
  "It'll make this go quicker.": "",
  "Tch, what a pain in the butt.": "",
  "I don't follow.": "",
  "He's going to change, so just give us a second.": "",
  "What in the world?": "",
  "He's in a new vampire drama, you see, and he'll be taking the stage in costume.": "",
  "I am Bram Sylvania III, and I have returned from the deepest depths of hell.": "",
  "...I guess he's really into the part.": "",
  "He's a method actor.": "",
  "Wait. Didn't you say this performance was outdoors? You going to be okay in all that direct sunlight?": "",
  "I am the progenitor vampire! Sunlight cannot rend my flesh.": "",
  "Wait a second... You're not expecting me to wear this ludicrous outfit, are you?": "",
  "Unfortunately... We are.": "",
  "...Of course you are.": "",
  "All we need you to do is wear this and get the attention of the reporters.": "",
  "We'll make it worth your while. Would 140,000 yen be suitable?": "",
  "...Fine. As long as it's just to get their attention.": "",
  "Right. You should probably know that, \"Offer unto me your pulsing blood!\" is Bram's catchphrase. Just in case.": "",
  "...I'm not sure you're paying me enough to say that.": "",
  "The venue is right in front of Kamuro Hills, so stop by when you're ready, Yagami-san.": "",
  "(Okay, I guess it's vampire time. I'll head to the plaza in front of Kamuro Hills.)": "",
  "(There's a ton of media gathered in front of the venue...)": "",
  "Hayama-san... So this is still really happening, I take it?": "",
  "Of course! There's no backing out now, okay?": "",
  "Just thought I'd ask...": "",
  "Shijima will be arriving in a tinted car soon, but as you can see...": "",
  "The media are prepared to ambush him.": "",
  "You weren't kidding...": "",
  "Yes. They'll swoop in on Shijima as soon as they catch even a glimpse of him.": "",
  "That's why we need you, Yagami-san. You have to keep their eyes on you.": "",
  "Here's the Bram outfit.": "",
  "(So this is what it feels like to sink to a new low.)": "",
  "Um, Hayama-san...": "",
  "Wow! You guys look identical!": "",
  "Okay, Yagami-san! Let's draw the media toward you!": "",
  "So I have to call them over with... the catchphrase?": "",
  "Right you are, Yagami-san! Be as dramatic as you can when you say it, please!": "",
  "All right. Here goes nothing.": "",
  "Huh? Why didn't that work?": "",
  "Yagami-san... I know you're just trying to improvise by changing \"pulsing\" to \"purest\" but...": "",
  "Pure-blood is a term for like, show dogs. It's not the blood of a beautiful maiden, if that's what you were thinking.": "",
  "The fans are very particular about catchphrases, so try not to improvise!": "",
  "I-I'm sorry. I guess I got carried away?": "",
  "Indeed. Be careful, now.": "",
  "(Why is this so hard?)": "",
  "Yagami-san. You're a vampire, not a mosquito.": "",
  "I-I was trying to be a vampire...": "",
  "You have to think like one, then! Please, try to capture Bram-sama's persona!": "",
  "(Bram-sama has that signature phrase. I think it was...)": "",
  "It's Bram-sama!": "",
  "Wow. They took the bait.": "",
  "Hey, let's go!": "",
  "Y-Yeah!": "",
  "Us too!": "",
  "Hayama-san! We have to run before they catch us!": "",
  "Crap, I wasn't fast enough. The others will get to him bef... Hm?": "",
  "Aah!": "",
  "...Crap.": "",
  "(Uh oh...)": "",
  "(Damn it! I'm surrounded...)": "",
  "Bram-sama! Do you deny the reports swirling about all the damage you and your motorcycle gang have caused!?": "",
  "Did you steal from people too!? Is it all true!?": "",
  "Tch! This isn't supposed to be happening...!": "",
  "Yagami-san... It's come to this! Just deal with these questions as best you can!": "",
  "All you have to do is answer them like Bram-sama would!": "",
  "Like... the fictional vampire I know nothing about would... Okay.": "",
  "I am the immortal vampire, above all judgment and laws by any scandals, past or present!": "",
  "Humanity means nothing to me! Your blood is the source of my limitless power, and I have thrived on it for centuries!": "",
  "U-Uh, I don't think that's the question I was asking...": "",
  "Yagami-san, you have the Bram-sama vibe down, but the timing is terrible!": "",
  "(You're the one who told me to talk like a vampire...)": "",
  "Well! Considering I am darkness incarnate, the crimes of my past are simply practice for my future evil deeds!": "",
  "Practice... for evil?": "",
  "Think upon it! If I was an upright citizen, would that not be more scandalous for a vampire!?": "",
  "B-Bram-sama... Incredible...": "",
  "What!? You can't just run away from your past!": "",
  "Wow, you sounded just like Bram-sama... But I think you might've gone a little overboard...": "",
  "(This vampire thing sucks.)": "",
  "No more messing around!": "",
  "You're not off the hook just because the statute of limitations expired!": "",
  "That's right! Bram-sama's theft has driven entire corporations out of business!": "",
  "What!? That's not true, is it!?": "",
  "Are you just going to keep dodging the responsibility!?": "",
  "Don't expect saying sorry will solve all your problems!": "",
  "(Crap! What do I do!?)": "",
  "In that case, I shall atone for my sins with money!": "",
  "How would you pay back the people from the past, then!?": "",
  "Blah...": "",
  "So many fans are in such deep pain over this incident...": "",
  "This isn't something you can just pay your way out of! This is hurting them at the heart!": "",
  "The heart? I have left my weak, human heart in the deepest pit of hell!": "",
  "You monster!": "",
  "(This is exhausting...)": "",
  "I shall personally apologize to each and every one of my victims!": "",
  "How would you even do that!?": "",
  "That motorcycle gang rampaged all over Kanto!": "",
  "D-Did we now?": "",
  "Trying to apologize to everyone you wronged sounds pretty unrealistic to me!": "",
  "(If an apology is no good, what should I do?)": "",
  "Yes, but you see... I have also considered community service!": "",
  "Huh? What kind?": "",
  "Uh, you know... Consoling the elderly, picking up trash around Kamurocho... That kind of thing?": "",
  "Wow!": "",
  "Bram-sama is going to perform for the elderly!?": "",
  "Bram-sama is going to pick up trash around the city!?": "",
  "(Did that one actually work?)": "",
  "Are you... serious about all this?": "",
  "...Of course! A vampire who breaks his word is cursed!": "",
  "This could go viral... Maybe this is his chance to turn things around.": "",
  "(Was that a bad answer? Well, it seems to be working regardless...)": "",
  "Huh? Yes. Oh, great.": "",
  "Yagami-san, it sounds like he made it into the venue just fine.": "",
  "(Glad it worked out... But are these guys going to let me go?)": "",
  "Huh? Where's Bram-sama?": "",
  "That's weird, he was just here a second ago...": "",
  "You did great, Yagami-san.": "",
  "I'm glad it's done.": "",
  "Hey, Bram-sama! I still have some questions...!": "",
  "(Damn, so persistent!)": "",
  "(I'll have to make a stealthy escape.)": "",
  "My adoring sacrifices... Thank you all for gathering here today! Now... Offer unto me your pulsing blood!": "",
  "Ahhhhh! Bram-sama!!!": "",
  "(Whew. I'm glad he made it on stage.)": "",
  "(But I think he should probably know what I said...)": "",
  "...So that's what happened.": "",
  "You're kidding right!? Community service!?": "",
  "Why did you rope me into something so stupid!?": "",
  "...I think it's great, actually.": "",
  "This'll be a very <font_kind=yakuza_italic>public</font_kind> way to show how sorry you are.": "",
  "B-But... It sounds lame...": "",
  "Think about it, though. You could gain new fans and impress lapsed ones all in one fell swoop.": "",
  "True... Hey! I know, why don't we just pay this guy to do it for me?": "",
  "With all due respect, I'm not going to atone for your mistakes in your place.": "",
  "Sure, I got you into this mess. But I wouldn't have had to if you hadn't been a punk in the past.": "",
  "Yagami-san is right, Shijima-kun.": "",
  "As an artist, as an adult... It's up to you to face your past and atone for it.": "",
  "Yes, I shall not allow chaos to sow its seeds upon this beautiful world...": "",
  "I swear upon my immortal life... That I shall atone!": "",
  "Waaah! Bram-sama!": "",
  "(I'm admittedly impressed that he can just turn it on like that.)": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Yes, exactly.": "ใช่ ถูกต้องเลย",
  "A problem?": "ปัญหาเหรอ?",
  "No problem. Let me know when you're ready.": "ไม่เป็นไร พร้อมเมื่อไหร่บอกฉันนะ",
  "O-Okay...": "อ-โอเค...",
  "Y-Yeah!": "เ-เออ!",
  "(Uh oh...)": "(แย่ล่ะสิ...)",
  "Wow!": "ว้าว!"
 }
}
